window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Baron Byron Balazs nears the end of his arduous journey; his bodyguard—the enigmatic and deadly Vampire Hunter D—has delivered him to his faraway home in Krauhausen. Having survived the near-epic journey, and many attempts on his life—ordered by his father, the dread Vampire Noble Lord Vlad—the baron thinks he is ready for his final battle, whatever the cost. But Lord Vlad is not so easily vanquished, as he unleashes yet another host of nefarious killers on his son, not least of whom is a mad doctor who was enlisted to perform sinister experiments on the young baron's mother years before!</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Scott McCormick, David Cui Cui, Mike Carnes, Mark Harrietha, Gabriel Michael, Danny Gavigan, Emily Beresford, Amanda Forstrom, Khaya Fraites, Terence Aselford, Sara Greenfield, Donald Guzzi, Drew Kopas, Shawn K. Jain, Ryan Haugen, John Kielty, Tyler Hyrchuk, Andrew Mimms, Yasmin Tuazon, Karen Novack, Thomas Penny, Bradley Foster Smith, Michael John Casey, Wyn Delano, Ian Russel, and Nora Achrati.</p>"; 
